From 89948cf7bc3278dfe54dceefe852a13731c1da73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 06:29:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs: add Wasmer Edge deploy option

---
 Anybuild  | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 README.md |  2 ++
 2 files changed, 21 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Anybuild

diff --git a/Anybuild b/Anybuild
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..cd60d17
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Anybuild
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# Generated by Anybuild v0.33.0 — https://anybuild.run
+# This file is yours to edit: add steps or override the serve below.
+
+load("//anybuild/tools:node_static.bzl", "nodestatic_build", "nodestatic_config", "nodestatic_serve")
+
+config = nodestatic_config(
+    schema = 1,
+    sws_version = "2.38.0",
+    static_dir = "dist",
+    node_package_manager = "pnpm",
+    node_framework = "astro",
+    node_server = "node",
+    node_version = "24",
+    pnpm_version = "8.15.9",
+)
+
+build = nodestatic_build(config)
+
+nodestatic_serve(config, build, name = "fresh")
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index cbda096..a76fb11 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -36,6 +36,8 @@ pnpm dev
 pnpm build
 ```
 
+4. Or deploy to Wasmer Edge: [![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=cssninjaStudio%2Ffresh) The link imports this public repository for building; it does not copy it into your GitHub account, so import your own copy or fork if you want to customize the site and redeploy on push. The root `Anybuild` file tells Wasmer to build the static Astro site (`pnpm run build`, served from `dist/`) instead of starting the dev server from the `start` script.
